{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121920","id":4166858799,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc74XTgv","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121920","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121920.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121920.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121920","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121920/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121920/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121920/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/554db51ec895137afd0c48cbe26e939569fcdf5a","number":121920,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add support for metadata in text scenes","user":{"login":"leandro-benedet-garcia","id":291051,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTA1MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/291051?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia","html_url":"https://github.com/leandro-benedet-garcia","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Supersedes #82532\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n* Closes #76366\r\n* Adds support for metadata in text scenes, they already worked with binary scenes before.\r\n* Old scenes without metadata works fine.\r\n* `[resource]` tag does not get added unless the scene have a metadata, there will be no change to old scenes.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n* Text Scenes can now have `resource_name`s and among other things\r\n* More things for sure are now possible because I had to go trough hoops to be able to add `PackedScenes` as metadata.\r\n  * Embedded metadata scenes are just saved as resources with the addition that they can have a node list\r\n* All of the above already worked before with the scene as binary, but not as text.\r\n* As a side effect, nested scene files are easier to read.\r\n\r\nAn example of how the scene is saved with metadata, including resources metadata, and even scenes:\r\n```ini\r\n[gd_scene format=3]\r\n\r\n[sub_resource type=\"Resource\" id=\"Resource_ntalc\"]\r\nresource_name = \"I'm a child resource\"\r\n\r\n[sub_resource type=\"PackedScene\" id=\"PackedScene_etj3x\"]\r\nresource_name = \"Hello world\"\r\nmetadata/other_resource = SubResource(\"Resource_ntalc\")\r\nmetadata/ExampleMetadata = Vector2i(40, 80)\r\nmetadata/string = \"The\r\nstring\r\nwith\r\nunnecessary\r\nline\r\n\t\\\\\r\nbreaks\"\r\n[node name=\"inner_named_node\" type=\"Node3D\" unique_id=1340554638]\r\n\r\n[sub_resource type=\"Resource\" id=\"Resource_llbx0\"]\r\nresource_name = \"I'm a child resource\"\r\n\r\n[resource]\r\nresource_name = \"Hello world\"\r\nmetadata/other_resource = SubResource(\"Resource_llbx0\")\r\nmetadata/ExampleMetadata = Vector2i(40, 80)\r\nmetadata/string = \"The\r\nstring\r\nwith\r\nunnecessary\r\nline\r\n\t\\\\\r\nbreaks\"\r\nmetadata/inner_scene = SubResource(\"PackedScene_etj3x\")\r\n\r\n[node name=\"named_node\" type=\"Node3D\" unique_id=2090576258]\r\n```\r\n\r\nUnit tests were added to make things slightly easier.\r\n\r\n### What this PR DOES NOT solve:\r\nThis PR only solves differences between what you can do with text or binary scene files. So the following problems will require future PRs (probably extending from this PR):\r\n* If you save the metadata, open the scene in the editor and save it, the metadata is lost. The same happens with the scene binary file. (PR with fix: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123163)\r\n* ~~You cannot edit metadata of scenes in the editor.~~ You can edit scene metadata in editor, you could for a while already, including custom scenes, you just couldn't save with `.tscn`, only with binary files without this PR,[ here's a video of me doing it in 4.7.1](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122231#issuecomment-5535698130).\r\n* Classes that inherit PackedScene does not have type information in the file. So the loader fails to load them.\r\n   The PR that aims to fix this is: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122180","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_